0..75 Comment "// The record type of `LC`\'s models, one field per component of `Model(LC)`"
76..153 Comment "// in the order the derivation mints them: contexts a type, substitutions and"
154..231 Comment "// terms families over it; the nine operations, each over the context indices"
232..308 Comment "// it ranges over; the six laws, each a path. A component\'s indices stand in"
309..384 Comment "// the order they first occur in the sorts it binds, so `liftTm` and law 2,"
385..464 Comment "// whose first binder is `s : Sub(d, g)`, take `d` before `g`. The syntax model"
465..540 Comment "// packs into it as `SyntaxNat` packs into `Nat`\'s (`model-in-source`), and"
541..602 Comment "// its operations run: β-reduction is a single substitution."
604..650 Comment "// The naturals; the syntax; the syntax model."
